[CustomMessages]
en.WelcomeDescription=Install FloatCanvas for the selected Windows users.%n%nSetup checks the required runtime and can download and install it if needed. Personal data is stored separately; uninstall keeps it unless you explicitly choose to delete it.
zhcn.WelcomeDescription=此向导将按所选范围安装浮绘 FloatCanvas。%n%n安装前会检查所需运行环境，缺少时可下载并安装。个人资料独立保存；卸载默认保留，也可明确选择删除。
en.LaunchFloatCanvas=Launch FloatCanvas
zhcn.LaunchFloatCanvas=启动浮绘
en.InvalidVersion=The installed package version is invalid.
zhcn.InvalidVersion=已安装程序的版本信息无效。
en.InvalidDirectory=Choose a local program directory separate from your FloatCanvas user data. Links and junctions are not supported.
zhcn.InvalidDirectory=请选择与浮绘用户数据分开的本地程序目录。不支持符号链接或目录联接。
en.DifferentInstallation=FloatCanvas is already installed in another directory. Upgrade that installation, or uninstall it before choosing a new location.
zhcn.DifferentInstallation=浮绘已安装在其他目录。请在原目录升级，或先卸载原安装再选择新位置。
en.UnfinishedUpdate=An application update is unfinished. Start FloatCanvas once to recover it, exit, and retry Setup.
zhcn.UnfinishedUpdate=有一次应用更新尚未完成。请先启动浮绘以完成恢复，退出后再重新安装。
en.PortableDirectory=This directory contains a portable or unregistered copy. Choose another directory for the installed edition.
zhcn.PortableDirectory=此目录包含 ZIP 版或未注册的浮绘副本。请为安装版选择其他目录。
en.InvalidMetadata=The installed package metadata is missing or invalid. Repair the existing installation before continuing.
zhcn.InvalidMetadata=已安装程序的包信息缺失或无效。请修复现有安装后再继续。
en.NewerVersion=A newer version is installed. Setup will not downgrade it.
zhcn.NewerVersion=已安装较新版本，不能通过此安装程序降级。
en.FilesBusy=Exit FloatCanvas and close programs using its installed files, then retry.
zhcn.FilesBusy=请退出浮绘，并关闭占用其程序文件的软件，然后重试。
en.ExistingInstallationFiles=This directory contains existing installation files. Choose a different program directory.
zhcn.ExistingInstallationFiles=此目录包含已有安装文件。请选择其他程序目录。
en.ExistingUninstallerFiles=This directory contains existing uninstaller files. Choose a different program directory.
zhcn.ExistingUninstallerFiles=此目录包含已有卸载程序。请选择其他程序目录。
en.InvalidDestination=A destination path is invalid or contains a link. Choose a different program directory.
zhcn.InvalidDestination=目标路径无效或包含链接。请选择其他程序目录。
en.FileConflict=A package file would overwrite an unrelated file: %1. Move that file or choose another installation directory.
zhcn.FileConflict=安装将覆盖不属于程序的文件：%1。请先移走该文件，或选择其他安装目录。
en.InvalidFileList=The installation file list is invalid.
zhcn.InvalidFileList=安装文件清单无效。
en.UninstallBlocked=Exit FloatCanvas and finish any interrupted update before uninstalling. Installation metadata must be intact and must not contain links.
zhcn.UninstallBlocked=请先退出浮绘，并完成被中断的更新后再卸载。安装信息必须完整，程序目录不能包含链接。
